      "originalText": "cnt = 0\n\nfor(i = 30; i >= 0; i--)\n{\n    if(checkIthBit(N, i)\n    {\n        cnt++\n    }\n}\n\nif cnt == 1:\n    print(\"Power of 2\")\nelse:\n    print(\"Not a power of 2\")",
